    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú Paulo oo taa tseék as Kristo Yesu barwaárí ngina gooiím dinkwa nee Timoteo hhiyaarén, amoorók Filemoni, sla'aarusmoorén, oo gadiyér tleéhh dinkwa nee atén, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee amór Afia, hho'oorén, nee amór Arkipo, askaarmoó Kristo adór aníng wa ale, nee amór múk kríshaanáy kudá' baraá do'ók wa burumburiimamiít.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú Baabuúrén nee Aako Yesu Kristo kuungá' nu tsuuqi nee nu waydií haniisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelo sleémeero án Mungú un sluufmiís as kuúng, nee un inslasláw baraá firor'eene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asma kángw sla'aarirók u axamiís nee haratlintaaór ta koon dír Aako Yesuwo nee dír múk hhohhó' sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Án kuúng gár us aleefiriiriim a tí, kuúng masók haratlintaaoorók an lamabu'uún dír múk hatlá' i alé. Gawaá adoorihe atén sleémeero tsuuqadá' sleémeero masók in tsaahha hhe'eesaán, kudá' ta koomaan baraá Kristowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma qwal/uú yaariír ugwa sláw nee gurkwa/asa, as sla'aarirók, asma munér múk hhohhó' kaa qwal/atís nee kuúng, hhiyaaeé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, baraá Kristowo aníng geeraawo a aleesláw kuúng uwa hara'ayiim tidá' kuúng tawa hariin tleehhamooro. Ala a sla'aaká kuúng uwa hara'ayiim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala án kuúng u firiím adoorí kawa tlehh ar sla'aari. Anuú Paulo a aako, nee slám a baraá tsegma as Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuúng u firiím as na/ay'eé' Onesimo. Inós aníng una laqwaál ar baraá Yesu baraá tsegmoó wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós bál geera kuúng ugwa gaa wa buuiiká, ala hamí u ló'wa gaa wa buu', kuúng nee aninge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamí ngun ki/ís amoorók i alé inósuú kilá', nee inós a adór muunaáeé' oo kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng ana slaá' iwa amor'eé' wa hooti, as aníng iwa daanduuwók wa sagadiyuusi, baraá tsegmuuwí ni diriia as Ya/abtór hho'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aga slaiiká gaa ngiwa kilooeé' tleehh, aqo adór kuúng ta kat, asma sla'aarirók mawa harakeés masók a adór kuúng ta sla'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaarí dooqa an gár Onesimo kusa paraátl diroge qoomár niinawe, as kuwa malé sleer, tay alhotá' ay alhhe'eesay wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimír hamí inós a adór lawaalmoowooká, ala a lawaalmo ba/a. Inós a hhiya' oo sla'aarusmo. Ar ló' aníng u slaá', ala kuúng u ak slá' asma a heewók, nee hamí a hhiyaawók baraá Kristowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng aníng bira tsáhh adór tar heewók baraá haratlintaaooro, inós ilaooheek adór anuú kilá' wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee kuúng bura /aytín, laqaá kuúng bur iinús gaaro, gaasíng daanduueé' gooiimeek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú Paulo al'axweesantí ngina gooiím ar dakw'eé' oo kilá', aníng ngi buú'. A mak sla'aaká uwa inslawtis adór kuúng tar iinar'eé' koón. Iinadá' a slafiingók oo kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala hhiyaaeé', gár ni slaa' bu'utuuwo a tí, Alee/iisáng gawaá kaangwihe ar loohír hariím baraá Aakoowo. Muunaáeé' qwal/aseek ar baraá Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tí ngina kuúng i gooiím asma ngiwa xuu' kuúng adoodá' án naa firiím a tléhh, nee kari harwaarahhás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár hatlá' a tí, dír hotaeé' amohhe'eeseek, asma aníng a harahhiíf, Mungú i alee/iis niwa amorhúngií hardah adoodá' kara firiindé' dír Munguhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epafra kudá' taa tseék dinkwa nee aníng asma Kristo Yesu kuúng u intsihhiimiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam Marko nee Aristarko nee Dema nee Luka, kudá' nee aníng algadiyuusá', kuúng u intsihhiimisiyá' sleeme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
